Itu bagus ya.

254
00:15:07,897 --> 00:15:12,576
Kereta selalu penuh orang.

255
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:15,373
Pagi juga penuh orang?

256
00:15:15,396 --> 00:15:20,029
Iya, pagi sangat penuh.

257
00:15:20,052 --> 00:15:22,952
Itu melelahkan ya.

258
00:15:22,976 --> 00:15:27,209
Iya, tapi sudah terbiasa.

259
00:15:27,232 --> 00:15:30,821
Dari stasiun jalan kaki ke rumah?

260
00:15:30,845 --> 00:15:35,678
Iya, dari stasiun jalan kaki 10 menit.

261
00:15:35,701 --> 00:15:38,257
Dekat ya.

262
00:15:38,281 --> 00:15:42,514
Saya dari halte bus 5 menit.

263
00:15:42,537 --> 00:15:45,571
Itu nyaman ya.

264
00:15:45,594 --> 00:15:50,533
Iya, tapi kalau hujan agak repot.

265
00:15:50,556 --> 00:15:53,623
Iya, betul juga.

266
00:15:53,646 --> 00:15:57,379
Hari ini cuacanya bagus, untung ya.

267
00:15:57,402 --> 00:16:02,469
Iya, ah, sudah sampai stasiun ya.

268
00:16:02,492 --> 00:16:06,392
Saya naik kereta dari sini.

269
00:16:06,415 --> 00:16:11,891
Oh gitu. Halte bus saya juga di sana.

270
00:16:11,914 --> 00:16:15,647
Kalau begitu, sampai di sini dulu ya hari ini.

271
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:19,259
Ya, sampai besok.

272
00:16:19,282 --> 00:16:21,669
Hati-hati.

273
00:16:21,693 --> 00:16:23,193
Adegan 7: Rencana Akhir Pekan / Weekend Plans

274
00:16:23,193 --> 00:16:27,307
Terima kasih atas kerja kerasnya minggu ini.

275
00:16:27,331 --> 00:16:30,041
Sampai jumpa, terima kasih.

276
00:16:30,064 --> 00:16:32,797
Sudah pulang?

277
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:36,599
Ya, saya pulang sekarang.

278
00:16:36,622 --> 00:16:40,656
Hari ini banyak berolahraga ya.

279
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:44,718
Iya, sedikit lelah.

280
00:16:44,742 --> 00:16:47,814
Besok kerja?

281
00:16:47,837 --> 00:16:52,006
Tidak, besok libur.

282
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:57,200
Oh begitu. Apa rencana akhir pekanmu?

283
00:16:57,224 --> 00:17:01,124
Saya akan menonton film dengan teman.

284
00:17:01,147 --> 00:17:05,280
Nonton film? Asyik ya.

285
00:17:05,304 --> 00:17:10,179
Ya, saya akan menonton film baru.

286
00:17:10,203 --> 00:17:12,595
Film apa?

287
00:17:12,618 --> 00:17:15,552
Film aksi.

288
00:17:15,575 --> 00:17:18,442
Kelihatannya seru.

289
00:17:18,465 --> 00:17:22,904
Kalau Emma, akhir pekan ini mau ngapain?

290
00:17:22,927 --> 00:17:26,761
Saya akan pergi ke gunung.

291
00:17:26,783 --> 00:17:31,136
Ke gunung? Pergi sendiri?

292
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:35,293
Tidak, pergi bersama keluarga.

293
00:17:35,316 --> 00:17:38,216
Itu bagus ya.

294
00:17:38,239 --> 00:17:42,672
Saya akan banyak mengambil foto di gunung.

295
00:17:42,695 --> 00:17:45,433
Suka fotografi?

296
00:17:45,457 --> 00:17:49,091
Ya, sangat suka.

297
00:17:49,115 --> 00:17:52,622
Foto apa yang biasanya diambil?

298
00:17:52,645 --> 00:17:56,199
Foto pemandangan dan bunga.

299
00:17:56,223 --> 00:18:00,756
Pasti indah ya. Saya juga ingin melihatnya.

300
00:18:00,779 --> 00:18:05,646
Kalau begitu, minggu depan saya tunjukkan fotonya di gym ya.

301
00:18:05,669 --> 00:18:08,369
Ya, tolong ya.

302
00:18:08,392 --> 00:18:12,726
Semoga cuaca hari Minggu cerah.

303
00:18:12,749 --> 00:18:17,449
Iya, kayaknya akan cerah.

304
00:18:17,472 --> 00:18:20,011
Terima kasih.

305
00:18:20,034 --> 00:18:22,313
Iya.

306
00:18:22,337 --> 00:18:26,839
Selamat menikmati filmnya besok ya.

307
00:18:26,862 --> 00:18:30,595
Setelah nonton film, mau ngapain?

308
00:18:30,618 --> 00:18:34,695
Makan bersama teman.

309
00:18:34,719 --> 00:18:38,352
Sepertinya akhir pekanmu akan menyenangkan.

310
00:18:38,375 --> 00:18:42,923
Iya. Sampai jumpa minggu depan.

311
00:18:42,947 --> 00:18:46,414
Ya, sampai minggu depan.

312
00:18:46,437 --> 00:18:47,937
Adegan 8: Cara Mengingat Kanji / How to Memorize Kanji

313
00:18:47,937 --> 00:18:49,929
Halo.

314
00:18:49,952 --> 00:18:52,728
Ah, halo.

315
00:18:52,752 --> 00:18:56,885
Kamu belajar di perpustakaan terus?

316
00:18:56,908 --> 00:19:01,208
Ya, sekitar satu jam.

317
00:19:01,231 --> 00:19:05,669
Oh gitu. Kamu hebat ya.

318
00:19:05,692 --> 00:19:09,485
Belajar bahasa Jepang memang susah ya.

319
00:19:09,508 --> 00:19:13,175
Apa yang paling sulit?

320
00:19:13,198 --> 00:19:18,237
Bagi saya, kanji yang paling sulit.

321
00:19:18,261 --> 00:19:22,648
Kanji memang banyak banget ya.

322
00:19:22,671 --> 00:19:27,171
Sulit banget untuk dihafal.

323
00:19:27,194 --> 00:19:31,363
Kamu biasanya gimana cara menghafal kanji?

324
00:19:31,387 --> 00:19:36,820
Saya menulisnya berulang-ulang di buku catatan.

325
00:19:36,843 --> 00:19:39,910
Jadi menghafal dengan menulis ya.

326
00:19:39,933 --> 00:19:42,366
Bagus ya.

327
00:19:42,389 --> 00:19:46,822
Kalau Emma, apa yang sulit?

328
00:19:46,845 --> 00:19:51,824
Saya sangat kesulitan dalam mendengarkan.

329
00:19:51,848 --> 00:19:54,606
Mendengar, ya?

330
00:19:54,629 --> 00:20:00,529
Iya, soalnya orang Jepang berbicara cepat sekali.

331
00:20:00,552 --> 00:20:05,666
Betul. Kadang saya juga nggak ngerti.

332
00:20:05,690 --> 00:20:09,863
Kamu suka nonton anime atau drama?

333
00:20:09,886 --> 00:20:13,804
Iya, sering nonton kok.

334
00:20:13,828 --> 00:20:18,895
Drama Jepang bagus banget buat latihan mendengarkan, lho.

335
00:20:18,918 --> 00:20:24,553
Oh ya? Kalau gitu, nanti aku bakal nonton lebih banyak.

336
00:20:24,576 --> 00:20:29,761
Dalam belajar bahasa Jepang, apa yang paling seru buat kamu?

337
00:20:29,785 --> 00:20:34,618
Yang paling seru itu ngobrol.

338
00:20:34,641 --> 00:20:37,751
Berbicara, ya?

339
00:20:37,775 --> 00:20:43,642
Iya. Ngobrol pakai bahasa Jepang sama teman tuh seru banget.

340
00:20:43,665 --> 00:20:47,768
Aku juga suka ngobrol.

341
00:20:47,791 --> 00:20:51,379
Kamu sering ngobrol sama teman sekelas?

342
00:20:51,402 --> 00:20:56,151
Iya, sering ngobrol pas jam istirahat.

343
00:20:56,174 --> 00:20:59,250
Itu bagus ya.

344
00:20:59,274 --> 00:21:02,907
Apa kamu juga belajar di akhir pekan?

345
00:21:02,930 --> 00:21:07,297
Iya, belajar sedikit aja.

346
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:10,620
Semangat ya!

347
00:21:10,643 --> 00:21:13,343
Terima kasih.

348
00:21:13,366 --> 00:21:14,866
Scene 9: Percakapan Sehari-hari: Laporan Akhir Pekan / Percakapan Sehari-hari: Aktivitas Akhir Pekan

349
00:21:14,866 --> 00:21:17,999
Eh, Suzuki-san.

350
00:21:18,022 --> 00:21:20,926
Eh, Emma.

351
00:21:20,950 --> 00:21:23,584
Selamat pagi.

352
00:21:23,607 --> 00:21:26,440
Selamat pagi.

353
00:21:26,463 --> 00:21:29,563
Sekarang mau ke sekolah?

354
00:21:29,586 --> 00:21:33,019
Ya, benar.

355
00:21:33,042 --> 00:21:36,776
Kemarin kan hari Minggu.

356
00:21:36,799 --> 00:21:39,708
Kamu ngapain aja?

357
00:21:39,731 --> 00:21:44,198
Kemarin aku pergi ke Yokohama.

358
00:21:44,222 --> 00:21:47,218
Yokohama?

359
00:21:47,241 --> 00:21:49,508
Bagus ya.

360
00:21:49,531 --> 00:21:53,631
Iya, seru banget.

361
00:21:53,654 --> 00:21:56,793
Pergi sama siapa?

362
00:21:56,817 --> 00:22:00,524
Pergi bareng teman.

363
00:22:00,547 --> 00:22:04,981
Di Yokohama ngapain aja?

364
00:22:05,004 --> 00:22:07,684
Lihat laut.

365
00:22:07,707 --> 00:22:10,374
Indah banget, lho.

366
00:22:10,397 --> 00:22:14,137
Terus, abis itu ngapain lagi?

367
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:18,130
Makan di Pecinan.

368
00:22:18,153 --> 00:22:21,187
Pecinan?

369
00:22:21,210 --> 00:22:24,396
Makan apa aja?

370
00:22:24,420 --> 00:22:28,402
Makan ramen sama pangsit.

371
00:22:28,425 --> 00:22:31,459
Enak nggak?

372
00:22:31,482 --> 00:22:35,859
Iya, enak banget.

373
00:22:35,882 --> 00:22:38,415
Bagus ya.

374
00:22:38,439 --> 00:22:42,550
Aku juga pengen ke Pecinan.

375
00:22:42,573 --> 00:22:47,007
Terus, Emma kemarin ngapain?

376
00:22:47,030 --> 00:22:52,463
Aku kemarin di rumah aja.

377
00:22:52,486 --> 00:22:55,553
Terus di rumah ngapain?

378
00:22:55,576 --> 00:22:59,972
Pagi-pagi bersihin kamar.

379
00:22:59,995 --> 00:23:02,828
Oh begitu.

380
00:23:02,851 --> 00:23:05,395
Pasti capek ya.

381
00:23:05,419 --> 00:23:09,486
Iya, sedikit lelah.

382
00:23:09,509 --> 00:23:12,876
Terus, abis itu ngapain lagi?

383
00:23:12,899 --> 00:23:16,732
Siangnya baca buku.

384
00:23:16,755 --> 00:23:19,622
Buku apa?

385
00:23:19,645 --> 00:23:23,178
Novel Jepang.

386
00:23:23,201 --> 00:23:26,701
Novel bahasa Jepang?

387
00:23:26,724 --> 00:23:29,424
Wah, hebat banget!

388
00:23:29,447 --> 00:23:34,184
Tidak, masih agak sulit.

389
00:23:34,207 --> 00:23:37,207
Apakah kamu pakai kamus?

390
00:23:37,231 --> 00:23:43,134
Iya, sambil pakai kamus, aku baca pelan-pelan.

391
00:23:43,157 --> 00:23:46,632
Sangat bermanfaat untuk belajar, ya.

392
00:23:46,655 --> 00:23:48,759
Iya.

393
00:23:48,783 --> 00:23:52,417
Eh, kereta sudah datang!

394
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:55,273
Ayo naik!

395
00:23:55,296 --> 00:23:56,796
Scene 10: Percakapan Musim Gugur / Autumn Conversations

396
00:23:56,796 --> 00:23:58,833
Halo.

397
00:23:58,856 --> 00:24:01,763
Ah, halo.

398
00:24:01,787 --> 00:24:05,892
Apakah kamu sering minum kopi di sini?

399
00:24:05,916 --> 00:24:09,549
Iya, kadang-kadang datang.

400
00:24:09,572 --> 00:24:13,916
Aku hari ini baru pertama kali datang.

401
00:24:13,939 --> 00:24:17,808
Kopi di sini enak, lho.

402
00:24:17,832 --> 00:24:21,665
Oh ya? Aku jadi penasaran.

403
00:24:21,688 --> 00:24:25,924
Baru-baru ini udaranya jadi dingin banget, ya.

404
00:24:25,948 --> 00:24:30,115
Iya, beneran dingin.

405
00:24:30,138 --> 00:24:33,873
Soalnya sekarang sudah bulan November.

406
00:24:33,897 --> 00:24:36,242
Musim gugur, ya.

407
00:24:36,265 --> 00:24:40,001
Iya, musim gugur.

408
00:24:40,024 --> 00:24:44,558
Aku paling suka musim gugur.

409
00:24:44,581 --> 00:24:46,539
Kenapa?

410
00:24:46,562 --> 00:24:50,540
Soalnya makanannya enak-enak.

411
00:24:50,563 --> 00:24:55,497
Betul juga. Buah-buahan di musim gugur memang enak.

412
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:59,953
Suzuki-san suka musim apa?

413
00:24:59,976 --> 00:25:03,493
Aku suka musim semi.

414
00:25:03,517 --> 00:25:06,650
Musim sakura, ya.

415
00:25:06,673 --> 00:25:10,973
Iya, soalnya bunganya cantik banget.

416
00:25:10,996 --> 00:25:15,935
Tapi musim semi anginnya agak kencang, ya.

417
00:25:15,959 --> 00:25:18,308
Iya, betul.

418
00:25:18,331 --> 00:25:23,064
Udah mulai dingin, gimana kondisi kamu?

419
00:25:23,087 --> 00:25:27,587
Sebenarnya, aku sedikit masuk angin.

420
00:25:27,610 --> 00:25:30,043
Gak apa-apa?

421
00:25:30,066 --> 00:25:34,933
Iya, udah minum obat, jadi gak apa-apa.

422
00:25:34,956 --> 00:25:40,389
Hari ini pulang cepat aja, terus tidur sambil hangat-hangat ya.

423
00:25:40,412 --> 00:25:42,729
Terima kasih.

424
00:25:42,753 --> 00:25:46,023
Ema-san gimana, baik-baik aja?

425
00:25:46,046 --> 00:25:49,546
Aku sehat kok.

426
00:25:49,569 --> 00:25:52,278
Syukurlah.

427
00:25:52,302 --> 00:25:56,294
Soalnya aku olahraga setiap pagi.

428
00:25:56,317 --> 00:25:58,817
Olahraga apa?

429
00:25:58,840 --> 00:26:02,607
Jalan kaki di taman dekat rumah.

430
00:26:02,630 --> 00:26:05,864
Itu bagus buat kesehatan.

431
00:26:05,887 --> 00:26:10,387
Iya, makanya aku gak pernah masuk angin.

432
00:26:10,410 --> 00:26:14,276
Besok aku juga mau mulai jalan kaki sedikit.

433
00:26:14,299 --> 00:26:18,233
Kalau gitu, kita jalan bareng yuk!

434
00:26:18,256 --> 00:26:21,389
Ya, tolong ya.